> I'm more worried about tented vias than fully open ones at least if they're thin enough for the epoxy to not just drip down; 
Not sure what you mean there, are you more worried about them being tented ? And if so, doesn't tented imply there is no dripping because the hole is closed ? 

Also, if you remember (I am still in the process of re-reading the entire thread), why where the via's tented only on one side in the first place ?
